{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cf496fb8c998c1266b3ba72f0108409c832d3e9cfe298f9e646b69701447af00", "ja": "（うん、今日は業務がよく捗る日だ！\n……そういえばみんなの姿を見かけない気が……）", "zh": "（嗯，今天工作进展得很顺利！……说起来，好像没看到大家的身影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "95efed3ae3805f5c21b7c76271938126c212a6c0a8b182b9ac0bd13562401c74", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\n{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊！原来你在这里！\n{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a538f3c09cd975e0ca0496824f57922e74955e3297a07f984c74e7371936cb4e", "ja": "ああ、翼。お疲れさま。なんか今日は\n静かな気がするけど、みんなどこに……。", "zh": "啊，翼。辛苦了。总觉得今天好安静，大家都去哪儿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b18c48bf3bd866974eb1815f8bbbe2469e33c741e77aae72506885676d79b50e", "ja": "{$P$}さん。やっぱりわたしの胸が\n大きくなるなら、そっちの方がいいですよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。要是我的胸部能变大，\n果然还是那样比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d331345ec869289136cc268c156e3635bc363edb6d1c75f74937e5ba6d6f903c", "ja": "ウェストは、もっと細い方がいいのかなぁ？\nでも、あんまり細くてもバランス悪いし～。", "zh": "腰围还是再细一点比较好吧？\n不过，太细了也会显得不协调～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c54ae5e46bb1a74732cf3f0236c10c26c00d512c61fd11ee97e2f1767b922293", "ja": "……。なんか不自然な質問が続いてるけど、\n何の話だ？", "zh": "……总觉得净问些不自然的问题，\n到底是在聊什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cc95dd0b0212d88f40fe0738cac902ffa8bce7c864d55cc67b65aea25b46b4e5", "ja": "いいから教えてくださいよ～。ダメぇ？", "zh": "别管那么多，告诉我嘛～不行吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c92f697477b02ff706204b6a8a5495dd2042fab84247d35aa8ac34f6a517fedd", "ja": "ダメじゃないが。……でも、俺がどう思うじゃなくて\n翼がどうなりたいか、が大事だと思うよ。", "zh": "倒也不是不行。……不过，比起我怎么想，我觉得重要的是翼想成为什么样的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8d4b3c59b671907169f184aaaea12556c1faacfdb8b6772469a668e620a1132c", "ja": "も～。わたしは、{$P$}さんが\n喜んでくれるわたしになりたいの！", "zh": "真是的～。我就是想成为能让{$P$}先生\n开心的自己嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b29755306ae009e7bc47ee75126a9d41809d05b4ab07589577adc87fe9e81f5", "ja": "わたしをスカウトして、アイドルにしてくれた、\n{$P$}さんなら……。", "zh": "如果是发掘我、让我成为偶像的{$P$}先生的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a0d82c1e65d0459554b970571986c34955c777cc5086b695cc3857824a3c4a75", "ja": "わたしを一番かわいくしてくれるはずだもん♪", "zh": "肯定能把我变得最可爱嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "295df7d833b804490927f0ad2c30fbf2b05a5c5583d28b50e0073520a162448d", "ja": "翼……。そうか、わかったよ。じゃあ、\n俺が一番うれしくなる翼を、正直に言おうかな。", "zh": "翼……这样啊，我明白了。那我就坦率地说说，能让我最开心的翼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fe3157586cdd528eda659897edcdca13aff29880a61a1d6eb289312e83229714", "ja": "ホント？　やっぱり胸が大きくて～、\nウェストがキュッてしまってるほうがいい？", "zh": "真的吗？果然还是胸部丰满、腰肢纤细的身材更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f1c3e933f399bcc759fcad77fd6f78aac454384f7977bd7530baaded5bc4f926", "ja": "翼が一番うれしいスタイルになること。\nそれが最高にうれしいな！", "zh": "能成为让翼最高兴的身材。那就让我最高兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8ed1ecb115c407195aca267629b2bb8b8b940744087369e49ac6364b4f05f372", "ja": "え～～～！　そんなのズルい～～～！\nもう、すぐそうやってはぐらかすんだから～！", "zh": "诶～～～！这样太狡猾了～～～！\n真是的，你总是马上就这样敷衍过去～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1015_p", "source_sha256": "278efc2242432368fc78c4f7b3f7f968b8faeb0af05ba22496c70ca72f1d2b26", "ja": "いや、本当のことだし。でも、突然どうしたんだ？\nスタイルなんて、急に変わるもんじゃないだろ？", "zh": "不是，确实是实话啊。不过，你怎么突然问这个？\n身材这种东西，不是说变就能变的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b929eefbe0bfc8df76043623fc055e2ce1a1d217cdf1270862f3bfad33bbda7d", "ja": "うん、今からみんなで……あ、やっぱりナイショ！\nはぐらかす人には、教えてあげませーん！", "zh": "嗯，我们现在要一起……啊，还是保密！\n对敷衍人的话，我才不告诉他呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a6c27200f121ddc01e7b6ec7cd4521b77f2b07a2901e07565e7f5b39f37ff15d", "ja": "あとで絶対ドキドキさせちゃうんだから。\n覚悟しておいてくださいねっ！　ふーんだ！", "zh": "待会儿绝对会让你心动不已的。\n做好心理准备吧！哼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0323_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ab09c6717d071d68380c85c6e8d93f0416f6b12c9cb117966ac2843510e3a710", "ja": "（行ってしまった……好きなスタイルに自分を変える？\nははは、ゲームじゃあるまいし！）", "zh": "（她走掉了……改变自己来迎合喜欢的风格？哈哈哈，又不是游戏！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
